  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:177px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Empress_Chynah.jpg\" title=\"Empress Chynah, Manglefeet's Manager\"><img alt=\"Empress Chynah, Manglefeet's Manager\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"180\" src=\"/images/Empress_Chynah.jpg\" width=\"175\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Empress_Chynah.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Empress Chynah, Manglefeet's Manager</div></div></div>\n<p>Empress Chynah stands on the steps behind Manglefeet. She will be immobile until his health is over half depleted, but then she activates and heals the Boss.  Once she activates she must be dealt with quickly.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
